Homepage: http://code.google.com/p/xbee-arduino/


Package: arduino-xbee
Architecture: all
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Arduino library for communicating with XBees in API mode
 Provides support for both Series 1 (802.15.4) and Series 2 (ZB
 Pro/ZNet). This library Includes support for the majority of packet
 types, including: TX/RX, AT Command, Remote AT, I/O Samples and Modem
 Status.
